### Summary of changes

- **`TeamQuickBar.vue`**: Wrapped everything in a `flex h-full` container. Added a thin vertical handle (`w-1 h-10 rounded-full`) on the right side of the quick bar, visible only when `isTeamBarCollapsed` is `true`. It emits `expand-team-bar` on click. Added `isTeamBarCollapsed` prop and `expand-team-bar` emit.

